### 1. 登录
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 将登录响应中的 data.accessToken 粘贴到此处
@token = 粘贴登录接口返回的accessToken

### 2. 查询当前登录用户
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 查询角色
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/system/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 查询用户列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/system/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 创建测试用户
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/system/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "displayName": "测试用户",
  "password": "Test@123456",
  "roleCodes": ["VIEWER"]
}

### 6. 停用用户
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/system/users/替换为用户ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false
}
